WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:01.590
Hey, I have a question Brittany,

00:00:01.590 --> 00:00:04.470
which is, you can read people,

00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:05.570
How do you think I would do?

00:00:05.570 --> 00:00:07.520
I've never skydived before

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:11.200
if I came to sign up and you knew me

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.060
or you know me as well as you know me,

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:14.858
how do you think I would do?

00:00:14.858 --> 00:00:16.040
I think you will do okay.

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:17.210
I mean, you're very tall,

00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:18.750
so that's a big consideration

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:20.900
because you have a lot of like,

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:22.780
a lot more body than I do

00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:24.603
so you can control the wind more.

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:28.330
Oh, so that's a plus.

00:00:28.330 --> 00:00:30.558
It's a plus if you do it right.

00:00:30.558 --> 00:00:32.028
(chuckles)

00:00:32.028 --> 00:00:32.861
Like, if you're on the front of me

00:00:32.861 --> 00:00:34.090
and you're doing all sorts of crazy stuff,

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:35.620
you're gonna outfly me, you know?

00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:36.550
So you have to really...

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:38.375
Well, I would be flailing a lot.

00:00:38.375 --> 00:00:39.250
(laughing)

00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:40.530
I mean, I'm just telling you right now,

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:43.670
I'd be flailing and you'd
be behind me, right?

00:00:43.670 --> 00:00:46.240
Yes, and nobody could
see me cause I'm small

00:00:47.140 --> 00:00:47.973
They wouldn't see you.

00:00:47.973 --> 00:00:49.690
People would think I
was parachuting alone.

00:00:49.690 --> 00:00:50.992
I'm so tall and gangly.

00:00:50.992 --> 00:00:52.088
Right, which will be cool for you.

00:00:52.088 --> 00:00:52.921
(laughs)

00:00:52.921 --> 00:00:53.754
Right, but here's,

00:00:53.754 --> 00:00:54.910
I can tell you a few things for a fact :

00:00:54.910 --> 00:00:57.394
One, my arms and legs
would be flailing wildly.

00:00:57.394 --> 00:00:58.227
(nodding)

00:00:58.227 --> 00:00:59.060
Okay.

00:00:59.060 --> 00:01:00.307
I would be shrieking,

00:01:00.307 --> 00:01:03.390
and not like a yee haw shriek,

00:01:03.390 --> 00:01:05.840
but a shriek of impending doom.

00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:06.673
Right. Right.

00:01:06.673 --> 00:01:07.506
Crying.

00:01:07.506 --> 00:01:10.960
And I would be trying to
reach back and claw at you.

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:13.680
I'd been trying to physically
claw and attack you

00:01:13.680 --> 00:01:17.360
because the fear part of my
brain, which is not reasonable,

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:21.000
would be blaming you
and wanting to kill you.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:22.051
You know what I mean?

00:01:22.051 --> 00:01:23.234
I get it, I get it.

00:01:23.234 --> 00:01:24.485
That's just honest.

00:01:24.485 --> 00:01:25.318
Yeah, no, I get it.

00:01:25.318 --> 00:01:26.151
And you know what? The honesty is helpful.

00:01:26.151 --> 00:01:29.480
Cause then I can prepare for
it and just like knock you out

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:30.467
before we get out or whatever.

00:01:30.467 --> 00:01:31.300
(laughing)

00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:32.440
Yeah, you should bring men.

00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:33.570
You should bring us.

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:35.750
It'd be your first dive that you ever did

00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:38.760
with a powerful syringe
of horse tranquilizer.

00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:40.050
Yes, right.

00:01:40.050 --> 00:01:42.173
And just as we get out of the door.

00:01:42.173 --> 00:01:43.006
When I would land.

00:01:43.006 --> 00:01:45.950
Now, when you land, how hard do you land?

00:01:45.950 --> 00:01:49.050
I've heard. It's like, you can
hurt yourself when you land.

00:01:49.050 --> 00:01:51.690
It's like, you're going,
it's like jumping off what?

00:01:51.690 --> 00:01:53.800
A 10 foot wall or an eight
foot wall or something.

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:57.580
So not anymore. Back when we
jumped with the round shoots,

00:01:57.580 --> 00:02:01.550
that was, but now they
fly a lot more forwards.

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:03.810
There's a lot of forward
speed and we just slide it

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:05.870
on our butts and it's actually quite soft.

00:02:05.870 --> 00:02:06.830
Okay. Okay.

00:02:06.830 --> 00:02:08.880
I think in world war II,

00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:10.720
a lot of people, they jump out of planes

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:12.100
and they break their leg when they landed,

00:02:12.100 --> 00:02:15.247
because if you didn't do it
just right, it was nasty.

00:02:15.247 --> 00:02:17.180
You are coming straight down.

00:02:17.180 --> 00:02:18.960
And what's your biggest fear of something

00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:21.390
that you might land in
accidentally when you land?

00:02:21.390 --> 00:02:22.830
Let's just say you get blown off course,

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:24.590
what's the thing you would
least want to land in?

00:02:24.590 --> 00:02:26.930
So I have never had this experience,

00:02:26.930 --> 00:02:27.763
but other people have,

00:02:27.763 --> 00:02:29.000
if you land in, you know,

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:30.970
you can look for a field
if you're not going to land

00:02:30.970 --> 00:02:32.710
at the airport and sometimes there's bulls

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:34.870
or like other aggressive animals.

00:02:34.870 --> 00:02:36.940
And apparently that's not
a great place to land.

00:02:36.940 --> 00:02:39.790
Can you imagine being a ball

00:02:39.790 --> 00:02:41.670
and you're in a bad mood anyway,

00:02:41.670 --> 00:02:44.750
and then this jackass
just falls out of the sky

00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:47.363
and lands and knocks
over your water trough.

00:02:48.210 --> 00:02:52.172
So can you land and then you're
attacked immediately, right?

00:02:52.172 --> 00:02:53.005
Right, exactly.

00:02:53.005 --> 00:02:54.150
Like you survive the skydive

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:55.539
and then you get killed by a bull.

00:02:55.539 --> 00:02:56.372
(gasps)

00:02:56.372 --> 00:02:58.980
I would try. I would love to,
if I got blown off course,

00:02:58.980 --> 00:03:01.830
I would want to land at
a big festive occasion,

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:03.460
like a wedding that was pretty fancy.

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:05.810
Right, cause everybody
gets so excited to see you.

00:03:05.810 --> 00:03:06.890
Well also I'd want

00:03:06.890 --> 00:03:10.650
to smash into a bunch of
stuff like cake, you know.

00:03:10.650 --> 00:03:13.410
I would love to land on someone's wedding

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:17.340
during a pretty important
part, smashed into the cake,

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:20.950
knock over all the wine,
slam into the, you know,

00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:23.050
the bride and the groom.

00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:24.390
Just, you know what I mean?

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:25.223
And then, and then,

00:03:25.223 --> 00:03:30.223
and then get up and act like
you guys ruined my skydiving.

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:32.820
Right. It is their fault.

00:03:32.820 --> 00:03:34.287
Yeah, that's what I would do.

00:03:34.287 --> 00:03:35.500
If you come do a tandem with me,

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:38.280
we can find a wedding and we'll do that.

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:42.290
Okay. You know, I have
never gone skydiving before

00:03:42.290 --> 00:03:43.380
and I have to admit,

00:03:43.380 --> 00:03:44.510
it terrifies me.

00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:45.580
But if I did it,

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:47.200
I would want to do it
with you, I really would.

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:48.033
Oh, thank you.

00:03:48.033 --> 00:03:49.550
No, you seem very cool

00:03:49.550 --> 00:03:51.610
and I would trust you a 100%

00:03:51.610 --> 00:03:54.960
and you also seem very funny.

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:56.385
I think we have a good time.

00:03:56.385 --> 00:03:58.410
Well, thank you, I think we would too.

00:03:58.410 --> 00:04:02.030
Yeah. I want to reserve a
slot with you if I do it.

00:04:02.030 --> 00:04:02.863
Okay. All right.

00:04:02.863 --> 00:04:04.840
I'm not saying a 100% I'm going to do it.

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:06.090
No, that's okay.

00:04:06.090 --> 00:04:07.290
Pretty sure I'm going to make,

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:09.088
I'm going to do something embarrassing.

00:04:09.088 --> 00:04:09.921
It's going to be in there.

00:04:09.921 --> 00:04:11.280
The flailing and you know.

00:04:11.280 --> 00:04:12.660
The flailing and the shrieking.

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:14.800
And you're probably going
to make, I know you,

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:18.370
you're going to have
one of those GoPros on,

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:21.760
and you are going to get
all the footage of me

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:25.690
begging for my life,
cursing you out, shrieking.

00:04:25.690 --> 00:04:26.523
The crying.

00:04:26.523 --> 00:04:30.417
Yeah. Yelling at God
saying, "I blame God."

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:34.690
Yeah. Just completely breaking
down as a human being,

00:04:34.690 --> 00:04:39.140
becoming a child, babbling,
crying, soiling myself.

00:04:39.140 --> 00:04:41.060
And then you would probably,
you would put that online.

00:04:41.060 --> 00:04:41.912
I know you would.

00:04:41.912 --> 00:04:43.714
Well yeah, it would go viral, so.

00:04:43.714 --> 00:04:45.964
(laughing)

